---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../site";
---
<Base title="Privacy notice">
  <section class="section wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="notice">Template for review. Have it checked against your business before you launch.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name, email and, if you add them, phone number and lodge details, to process orders and personalise regalia.</li>
      <li>Delivery address and order history, which we keep for 6 years as Irish tax law requires.</li>
      <li>If you sign in with Google or Facebook, we receive your name and email address only.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>Card payments are handled by Stripe. We never see or store your card number.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and storage</h2>
    <p>We store your basket, currency and sign-in session in your browser's local storage. We don't use advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR you can ask for a copy of your data, correct it or delete it. You can delete your account yourself in Account, Security. For anything else, email {SITE.email}. You can also complain to the Data Protection Commission (dataprotection.ie).</p>
  </section>
</Base>
